# The first real crash: bad_alloc on the library task listing a long book's chapters,
# with chat running.
expect-crash "bad_alloc"
wait 3000
press enter
wait-text "HOME" 15000
press 3
wait-text "Stinky" 90000
repeat 60
press down down down
press enter
wait 900
press left
wait 1000
end-repeat
report no crash so far
